{"id": "f53d75fc-1a47-4695-a0e7-ac226076db16", "slug": "platform-interface-1", "title": "Platform Interface", "description": "Platform Interface Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Platform Interface\"\ndescription: \"Platform Interface Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  secondary: \"#050508\"\n  accent: \"#94A3B8\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#2A2A35\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#2A2A35\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"-apple-system\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"-apple-system\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Platform Interface\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Aksonvady Phomhome (@aksonvady). Views: 39; favorites: 6; remixes: 1.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, threejs, dither, effect.\n## Overview\nPlatform Interface Background Effect is designed for delivering a visual treatment or immersive background effect. Key features include atmospheric visuals, motion depth, and flexible presentation layering. It is suitable for visual-first pages, motion studies, and atmospheric hero treatments.\n\nInitialize immediately. Your platform operates at peak efficiency from inception and is dynamically optimized for maximum throughput. Begin Now Zero config, full power. Leverage advanced animation libraries and dynamic…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Initialize immediately. Your platform operates at peak efficiency from inception and is dynamically optimized for maximum throughput.; Zero config, full power.; Unleash your vision.; Seamless Data Insights.; Project Administration..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FFFFFF, secondary #050508, accent #94A3B8, background #FFFFFF, surface #2A2A35, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse -apple-system for display moments and -apple-system for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased bg-[#050508] text-slate-300 selection:bg-purple-500/30 selection:text-white overflow-x-hidden\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Platform Interface</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        /* Base typography refinement */\n        body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \"Apple Color Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Emoji\", \"Segoe UI Symbol\"; }\n\n        /* Dither Pattern Overlay */\n        .dither-overlay {\n            background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAQAAAAEAQMAAACTPww9AAAABlBMVEX///8AAABVwtN+AAAAAnRSTlP/AOW3MEoAAAAOSURBVAjXY2BgYGBgAAAABQABpD2aAwAAAABJRU5ErkJggg==');\n            background-repeat: repeat;\n            image-rendering: pixelated;\n            opacity: 0.15;\n            mix-blend-mode: overlay;\n        }\n\n        /* Subtle diagonal grid lines for Framed Grid layout */\n        .diagonal-texture {\n            background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 6px);\n        }\n\n        /* Skeuomorphic utilities */\n        .skeuo-surface {\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(30,30,40,0.8) 0%, rgba(15,15,22,0.9) 100%);\n            box-shadow:\n                inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.1), /* Top highlight */\n                inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.8),    /* Bottom shadow */\n                inset 1px 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02),\n                inset -1px 0 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02),\n                0 10px 30px -10px rgba(0,0,0,0.8); /* Outer drop shadow */\n        }\n\n        .skeuo-border {\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 100%);\n            padding: 1px;\n            border-radius: inherit;\n        }\n\n        /* WebGL Canvas Positioning */\n        #laser-canvas {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100vw;\n            height: 100vh;\n            z-index: 0;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Ambient Glow behind main content */\n        .ambient-blob {\n            position: absolute;\n            filter: blur(120px);\n            opacity: 0.4;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Hide scrollbar for code blocks */\n        .no-scrollbar::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }\n        .no-scrollbar { -ms-overflow-style: none; scrollbar-width: none; }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen text-sm overflow-x-hidden\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"laser-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Dither Background & Ambient Blobs -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#050508]\"></div>\n        <div class=\"ambient-blob bg-purple-900/40 w-[800px] h-[800px] top-[-200px] left-[-200px] animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 8s;\"></div>\n        <div class=\"ambient-blob bg-blue-900/30 w-[600px] h-[600px] bottom-[-100px] right-[-100px] animate-pulse\" style=\"animation-duration: 10s; animation-delay: 2s;\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 dither-overlay\"></div>\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[#050508]/80 to-[#050508]\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Framed Grid Lines Overlay -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none flex justify-center opacity-30\">\n        <!-- Container bounds -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-7xl h-full border-x border-white/10 relative\">\n            <!-- Corner markers -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/30 bg-black\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/30 bg-black\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/30 bg-black\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-[-3px] w-1.5 h-1.5 border border-white/30 bg-black\"></div>\n            <!-- Center dividing line -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-1/2 w-px h-full bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n            <!-- Horizontal dividing lines -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 left-0 w-full h-px bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-3/4 left-0 w-full h-px bg-white/[0.03]\"></div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-32 pb-24 flex flex-col items-center\">\n\n        <!-- Hero Section -->\n        <section class=\"w-full max-w-4xl mb-24 gs-reveal\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-[3.5rem] leading-[1.1] font-medium tracking-tight mb-6\">\n                <span class=\"text-white\">Initialize immediately.</span>\n                <span class=\"text-slate-500\">Your platform operates at peak efficiency from inception and is dynamically optimized for maximum throughput.</span>\n            </h1>\n\n            <!-- Button Wrapper for Glow -->\n            <div class=\"relative inline-block mt-8 group gs-reveal\">\n                <!-- Outer Glow -->\n                <div class=\"absolute -inset-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-600 via-purple-600 to-indigo-600 rounded-full blur-xl opacity-50 group-hover:opacity-80 transition duration-1000 group-hover:duration-200\"></div>\n                <!-- Skeuomorphic Button -->\n                <button class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center gap-3 px-8 py-3.5 bg-[#12121a] rounded-full border border-white/10 overflow-hidden shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2),_0_4px_20px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] transition-transform hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]\">\n                    <!-- Inner Gradient Overlay -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-500/20 via-purple-500/20 to-indigo-500/20 opacity-80\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10 text-white font-medium tracking-wide\">Begin Now</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:alt-arrow-right-linear\" class=\"relative z-10 text-white text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Grid Section -->\n        <section class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 relative\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1: Code Window -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-1 rounded-[1.5rem] skeuo-border gs-card group\">\n                <div class=\"h-full rounded-[1.5rem] skeuo-surface relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row diagonal-texture p-8 md:pr-0\">\n                    <!-- Text Area -->\n                    <div class=\"md:w-5/12 flex flex-col justify-center z-10 md:pr-4 mb-8 md:mb-0\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-3 tracking-tight\">Zero config, full power.</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-[13px]\">Leverage advanced animation libraries and dynamic data binding to construct immersive environments that surpass standard templates.</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Visual Area: Code Window -->\n                    <div class=\"md:w-7/12 relative min-h-[250px] flex items-center justify-end z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute right-[-20px] w-full max-w-sm rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0a0a0f]/90 backdrop-blur-md shadow-2xl overflow-hidden transform transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:-translate-x-2\">\n                            <!-- Window Header -->\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-3 border-b border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex gap-1.5 mr-6\">\n                                        <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-600\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-600\"></div>\n                                        <div class=\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-slate-600\"></div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"flex gap-6 text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-500\">\n                                        <span class=\"text-white\">CSS</span>\n                                        <span>React</span>\n                                        <span>Tailwind</span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <button id=\"copy-btn\" class=\"text-slate-500 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center justify-center cursor-pointer\" title=\"Copy Code\">\n                                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:copy-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Code Content -->\n                            <div class=\"p-4 text-[11px] font-mono leading-relaxed text-slate-400 overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar\">\n                                <div class=\"flex\"><span class=\"w-6 text-slate-600 select-none\">1</span><span class=\"text-slate-500 italic\">// Define structural logic</span></div>\n                                <div class=\"flex\"><span class=\"w-6 text-slate-600 select-none\">2</span><span>&nbsp;</span></div>\n                                <div class=\"flex\"><span class=\"w-6 text-slate-600 select-none\">3</span><span class=\"text-purple-400\">import</span> { Controller } <span class=\"text-purple-400\">from</span> <span class=\"text-green-300\">'@core/sys'</span>;</div>\n                                <div class=\"flex\"><span class=\"w-6 text-slate-600 select-none\">4</span><span>&nbsp;</span></div>\n                                <div class=\"flex\"><span class=\"w-6 text-slate-600 select-none\">5</span><span class=\"text-purple-400\">const</span> <span class=\"text-blue-300\">initSequence</span> = <span class=\"text-purple-400\">async</span> () => {</div>\n                                <div class=\"flex\"><span class=\"w-6 text-slate-600 select-none\">6</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"text-purple-400\">await</span> Controller.<span class=\"text-blue-300\">mount</span>({</div>\n                                <div class=\"flex\"><span class=\"w-6 text-slate-600 select-none\">7</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;mode: <span class=\"text-green-300\">'production'</span>,</div>\n                                <div class=\"flex\"><span class=\"w-6 text-slate-600 select-none\">8</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;strict: <span class=\"text-pink-400\">true</span></div>\n                                <div class=\"flex\"><span class=\"w-6 text-slate-600 select-none\">9</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;});</div>\n                                <div class=\"flex\"><span class=\"w-6 text-slate-600 select-none\">10</span>};</div>\n                                <div class=\"flex\"><span class=\"w-6 text-slate-600 select-none\">11</span><span>&nbsp;</span></div>\n                                <div class=\"flex\"><span class=\"w-6 text-slate-600 select-none\">12</span><span class=\"text-blue-300\">initSequence</span>();</div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: Concentric Dots -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-1 rounded-[1.5rem] skeuo-border gs-card group\" id=\"dots-card\">\n                <div class=\"h-full rounded-[1.5rem] skeuo-surface relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col diagonal-texture p-8\">\n                    <!-- Visual Area -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow flex items-center justify-center relative min-h-[200px] mb-8\" id=\"dots-container\">\n                        <!-- SVG dots generated by JS -->\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Text Area -->\n                    <div class=\"z-10 pointer-events-none\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-3 tracking-tight\">Unleash your vision.</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-[13px]\">Quickly enhance your interfaces by integrating sophisticated geometric patterns and responsive structural elements with precise control.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3: Bar Chart -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-1 rounded-[1.5rem] skeuo-border gs-card group\">\n                <div class=\"h-full rounded-[1.5rem] skeuo-surface relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col diagonal-texture p-8\">\n                    <!-- Visual Area -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow relative min-h-[220px] mb-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center\">\n                        <!-- Mock Chart Panel -->\n                        <div class=\"w-full max-w-[280px] h-full flex flex-col justify-between relative mt-4\">\n                            <!-- Toggle -->\n                            <div class=\"flex p-1 bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/10 rounded-full w-fit mx-auto mb-6 shadow-inner relative z-20\">\n                                <button class=\"chart-toggle px-4 py-1 text-[11px] rounded-full text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer\" data-period=\"day\">Day</button>\n                                <button class=\"chart-toggle px-4 py-1 text-[11px] rounded-full bg-[#2a2a35] text-white shadow-sm border border-white/5 cursor-pointer\" data-period=\"week\">Week</button>\n                                <button class=\"chart-toggle px-4 py-1 text-[11px] rounded-full text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer\" data-period=\"month\">Month</button>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- Grid & Bars -->\n                            <div class=\"relative flex-grow flex items-end justify-between px-2 pb-6 border-b border-white/10\">\n                                <!-- Y Axis Labels -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute left-[-20px] h-full flex flex-col justify-between py-6 text-[9px] text-slate-600\">\n                                    <span>100%</span>\n                                    <span>60%</span>\n                                    <span>20%</span>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Horizontal Guide Lines -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col justify-between py-6 pointer-events-none\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-white/[0.02]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-white/[0.02]\"></div>\n                                    <div class=\"w-full h-px bg-white/[0.02]\"></div>\n                                </div>\n\n                                <!-- Bars -->\n                                <div class=\"chart-bar w-10 h-[80%] bg-gradient-to-t from-white/5 to-white/20 rounded-t-sm border-t border-x border-white/10 relative group-hover:from-purple-500/10 group-hover:to-purple-400/30 transition-all duration-500\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"chart-bar w-10 h-[50%] bg-gradient-to-t from-white/5 to-white/20 rounded-t-sm border-t border-x border-white/10 relative group-hover:from-purple-500/10 group-hover:to-purple-400/30 transition-all duration-500 delay-75\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"chart-bar w-10 h-[35%] bg-gradient-to-t from-white/5 to-white/20 rounded-t-sm border-t border-x border-white/10 relative group-hover:from-purple-500/10 group-hover:to-purple-400/30 transition-all duration-500 delay-150\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"chart-bar w-10 h-[90%] bg-gradient-to-t from-white/5 to-white/20 rounded-t-sm border-t border-x border-white/10 relative group-hover:from-purple-500/10 group-hover:to-purple-400/30 transition-all duration-500 delay-200\"></div>\n                            </div>\n\n                            <!-- X Axis Labels -->\n                            <div class=\"flex justify-between px-2 pt-3 text-[9px] text-slate-600 w-full absolute bottom-0\">\n                                <span>1-7 nov</span>\n                                <span>8-14 nov</span>\n                                <span>15-21 nov</span>\n                                <span>22-28 nov</span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Text Area -->\n                    <div class=\"z-10 pointer-events-none\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-3 tracking-tight\">Seamless Data Insights.</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-[13px]\">Gain clear visibility into complex metrics. Effortlessly monitor performance, track contextual anomalies, and navigate through historical trends.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 4: Layered Panels -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-1 rounded-[1.5rem] skeuo-border gs-card group cursor-pointer\" id=\"panels-card\">\n                <div class=\"h-full rounded-[1.5rem] skeuo-surface relative overflow-hidden flex flex-col diagonal-texture p-8\">\n                    <!-- Visual Area -->\n                    <div class=\"flex-grow relative min-h-[220px] mb-8 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\">\n                        <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[280px] h-[160px]\">\n                            <!-- Layer 3 (Back) -->\n                            <div class=\"panel-layer absolute top-0 right-0 w-[85%] h-full rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-[#1a1a24]/50 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-lg transform transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-2 group-hover:-translate-y-2\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-white/[0.03] to-transparent\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Layer 2 (Middle) -->\n                            <div class=\"panel-layer absolute top-[10px] right-[15px] w-[90%] h-full rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#20202c]/70 backdrop-blur-md shadow-xl transform transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1\">\n                                <div class=\"w-full h-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_right,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-white/[0.04] to-transparent flex flex-col justify-end p-4\">\n                                     <div class=\"w-1/3 h-1.5 bg-white/10 rounded-full mb-2\"></div>\n                                     <div class=\"w-1/2 h-1.5 bg-white/5 rounded-full\"></div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <!-- Layer 1 (Front) -->\n                            <div class=\"panel-layer absolute top-[20px] right-[30px] w-full h-full rounded-xl border border-white/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#2a2a38] to-[#161620] shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.1)] overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-end p-5 transform transition-transform duration-500\">\n                                <!-- Abstract lines in front card -->\n                                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20\" style=\"background-image: repeating-radial-gradient(circle at 100% 50%, transparent 0, transparent 4px, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 5px, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 6px);\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"relative z-10 w-2/3 h-2 bg-white/20 rounded-full mb-2\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"relative z-10 w-4/5 h-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full mb-2\"></div>\n                                <div class=\"relative z-10 w-1/2 h-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full\"></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Text Area -->\n                    <div class=\"z-10 pointer-events-none\">\n                        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-medium text-white mb-3 tracking-tight\">Project Administration.</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-400 leading-relaxed text-[13px]\">Streamline the organization of your digital assets. Implement structured hierarchies to review and refine architectural changes prior to deployment.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </section>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Scripts -->\n    <script>\n        // 1. Generate Concentric Dots SVG for Card 2\n        const generateDots = () => {\n            const container = document.getElementById('dots-container');\n            let svgContent = `<svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\" class=\"w-full h-full max-w-[200px] opacity-60 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-700\">`;\n\n            const centerX = 100;\n            const centerY = 100;\n            const rings = 8;\n\n            for (let i = 1; i <= rings; i++) {\n                const radius = i * 11;\n                const dotCount = Math.floor(2 * Math.PI * radius / 6); // Space out dots based on circumference\n\n                for (let j = 0; j < dotCount; j++) {\n                    const angle = (j / dotCount) * 2 * Math.PI;\n                    const x = centerX + radius * Math.cos(angle);\n                    const y = centerY + radius * Math.sin(angle);\n\n                    // Fade out inner rings, vary size slightly\n                    const opacity = 0.2 + (i / rings) * 0.8;\n                    const r = 0.8 + (i/rings) * 0.5;\n\n                    svgContent += `<circle cx=\"${x}\" cy=\"${y}\" r=\"${r}\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" opacity=\"${opacity}\" />`;\n                }\n            }\n            svgContent += `</svg>`;\n            container.innerHTML = svgContent;\n        };\n\n        // 2. WebGL Laser Background implementation\n        const initLaser = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('laser-canvas');\n            const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl');\n            if (!gl) return;\n\n            const vsSource = `\n                attribute vec2 position;\n                void main() { gl_Position = vec4(position, 0.0, 1.0); }\n            `;\n\n            const fsSource = `\n                precision highp float;\n                uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n                uniform float u_time;\n\n                float hash(vec2 p) { return fract(1e4 * sin(17.0 * p.x + p.y * 0.1) * (0.1 + abs(sin(p.y * 13.0 + p.x)))); }\n                float noise(vec2 x) {\n                    vec2 i = floor(x);\n                    vec2 f = fract(x);\n                    float a = hash(i);\n                    float b = hash(i + vec2(1.0, 0.0));\n                    float c = hash(i + vec2(0.0, 1.0));\n                    float d = hash(i + vec2(1.0, 1.0));\n                    vec2 u = f * f * (3.0 - 2.0 * f);\n                    return mix(a, b, u.x) + (c - a) * u.y * (1.0 - u.x) + (d - b) * u.x * u.y;\n                }\n                float fbm(vec2 x) {\n                    float v = 0.0;\n                    float a = 0.5;\n                    vec2 shift = vec2(100.0);\n                    mat2 rot = mat2(cos(0.5), sin(0.5), -sin(0.5), cos(0.50));\n                    for (int i = 0; i < 4; ++i) {\n                        v += a * noise(x);\n                        x = rot * x * 2.0 + shift;\n                        a *= 0.5;\n                    }\n                    return v;\n                }\n\n                void main() {\n                    vec2 uv = (gl_FragCoord.xy - 0.5 * u_resolution.xy) / u_resolution.y;\n                    float dist = abs(uv.x);\n                    vec3 brandColor = vec3(0.6, 0.2, 0.9);\n\n                    float coreThickness = 0.001;\n                    float core = coreThickness / (dist + 0.0001);\n                    core = pow(core, 1.5);\n                    vec3 coreColor = mix(vec3(1.0, 0.8, 1.0), vec3(1.0), core);\n\n                    float haloThickness = 0.015;\n                    float halo = haloThickness / (dist + 0.005);\n                    vec3 haloColor = brandColor * halo * 0.5;\n\n                    vec2 noiseUv = uv * 3.0;\n                    noiseUv.y -= u_time * 0.2;\n                    float n = fbm(noiseUv);\n\n                    float smokeScatter = smoothstep(0.5, 0.0, dist);\n                    float smoke = n * smokeScatter * 0.15;\n                    vec3 smokeColor = mix(brandColor * 0.3, vec3(0.1, 0.1, 0.3), n) * smoke;\n\n                    vec3 finalColor = (coreColor * core) + haloColor + smokeColor;\n                    float verticalFade = smoothstep(0.5, 0.0, abs(uv.y));\n                    finalColor *= verticalFade * 1.5;\n                    finalColor *= 0.8 + 0.2 * sin(u_time * 2.0);\n\n                    gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor, 1.0);\n                }\n            `;\n\n            const compileShader = (type, source) => {\n                const s = gl.createShader(type);\n                gl.shaderSource(s, source);\n                gl.compileShader(s);\n                return s;\n            };\n\n            const program = gl.createProgram();\n            gl.attachShader(program, compileShader(gl.VERTEX_SHADER, vsSource));\n            gl.attachShader(program, compileShader(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, fsSource));\n            gl.linkProgram(program);\n            gl.useProgram(program);\n\n            const vertices = new Float32Array([-1, -1, 1, -1, -1, 1, 1, 1]);\n            const buffer = gl.createBuffer();\n            gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buffer);\n            gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, vertices, gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n\n            const positionLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(program, 'position');\n            gl.enableVertexAttribArray(positionLoc);\n            gl.vertexAttribPointer(positionLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n\n            const resLoc = gl.getUniformLocation(program, 'u_resolution');\n            const timeLoc = gl.getUniformLocation(program, 'u_time');\n\n            const render = (time) => {\n                if (canvas.width !== window.innerWidth || canvas.height !== window.innerHeight) {\n                    canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n                    canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n                    gl.viewport(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n                    gl.uniform2f(resLoc, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n                }\n                gl.uniform1f(timeLoc, time * 0.001);\n                gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n                requestAnimationFrame(render);\n            };\n            requestAnimationFrame(render);\n        };\n\n        // 3. GSAP Animations\n        const initAnimations = () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power3.out\" } });\n\n            tl.fromTo(\".gs-reveal h1\",\n                { y: 30, opacity: 0 },\n                { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1, delay: 0.2 }\n            )\n            .fromTo(\".gs-reveal button\",\n                { y: 20, opacity: 0 },\n                { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 0.8 },\n                \"-=0.6\"\n            );\n\n            gsap.fromTo(\".gs-card\",\n                { y: 40, opacity: 0 },\n                {\n                    y: 0,\n                    opacity: 1,\n                    duration: 0.8,\n                    stagger: 0.15,\n                    ease: \"power2.out\",\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: \".grid\",\n                        start: \"top 80%\",\n                        toggleActions: \"play none none none\"\n                    }\n                }\n            );\n        };\n\n        // 4. Interactive Card Functionality\n        const initCardInteractivity = () => {\n            // Card 1: Copy Code Functionality\n            const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copy-btn');\n            if(copyBtn) {\n                copyBtn.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n                    e.preventDefault();\n                    const code = `import { Controller } from '@core/sys';\\n\\nconst initSequence = async () => {\\n  await Controller.mount({\\n    mode: 'production',\\n    strict: true\\n  });\\n};\\n\\ninitSequence();`;\n                    navigator.clipboard.writeText(code);\n\n                    const originalIcon = copyBtn.innerHTML;\n                    copyBtn.innerHTML = '<iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-sm text-green-400\"></iconify-icon>';\n                    setTimeout(() => { copyBtn.innerHTML = originalIcon; }, 2000);\n                });\n            }\n\n            // Card 2: Interactive Dots Parallax\n            const dotsCard = document.getElementById('dots-card');\n            const dotsContainer = document.getElementById('dots-container');\n            if(dotsCard && dotsContainer) {\n                dotsCard.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                    const rect = dotsCard.getBoundingClientRect();\n                    const x = (e.clientX - rect.left - rect.width/2) * 0.1;\n                    const y = (e.clientY - rect.top - rect.height/2) * 0.1;\n                    gsap.to(dotsContainer, { x, y, duration: 0.5, ease: \"power2.out\" });\n                });\n                dotsCard.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                    gsap.to(dotsContainer, { x: 0, y: 0, duration: 0.8, ease: \"elastic.out(1, 0.3)\" });\n                });\n            }\n\n            // Card 3: Interactive Chart Toggles\n            const toggles = document.querySelectorAll('.chart-toggle');\n            const bars = document.querySelectorAll('.chart-bar');\n            const chartData = {\n                day: ['40%', '70%', '20%', '60%'],\n                week: ['80%', '50%', '35%', '90%'],\n                month: ['50%', '90%', '70%', '100%']\n            };\n\n            toggles.forEach(toggle => {\n                toggle.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n                    e.preventDefault();\n                    // Reset styling\n                    toggles.forEach(t => {\n                        t.className = \"chart-toggle px-4 py-1 text-[11px] rounded-full text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer\";\n                    });\n                    // Set active\n                    toggle.className = \"chart-toggle px-4 py-1 text-[11px] rounded-full bg-[#2a2a35] text-white shadow-sm border border-white/5 cursor-pointer\";\n\n                    // Update heights\n                    const period = toggle.getAttribute('data-period');\n                    bars.forEach((bar, i) => {\n                        bar.style.height = chartData[period][i];\n                    });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Card 4: Interactive Panels Shuffle\n            const panelsCard = document.getElementById('panels-card');\n            const panels = document.querySelectorAll('.panel-layer');\n            if(panelsCard && panels.length) {\n                panelsCard.addEventListener('click', () => {\n                    gsap.timeline()\n                        .to(panels, { x: \"+=20\", y: \"-=20\", rotation: \"random(-8, 8)\", duration: 0.2, stagger: 0.05, ease: \"power2.out\" })\n                        .to(panels, { x: 0, y: 0, rotation: 0, duration: 0.4, stagger: 0.05, ease: \"back.out(1.5)\", clearProps: \"transform\" }, \"+=0.1\");\n                });\n            }\n        };\n\n        // Initialize everything\n        window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            generateDots();\n            initLaser();\n            initAnimations();\n            initCardInteractivity();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "platform-interface-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/platform-interface-1.jpg", "source_name": "platform-interface-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 107, "forks": 2, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "2e815afb-cac1-4c01-90e1-cf3810246e35", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-06-30T17:28:52.061929+00:00"}